21:["$","section","How We Use Data",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"How We Use Data"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","To create and manage accounts, authenticate users, and keep sessions active across web, mobile, and connected ChatGPT experiences.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To create and manage accounts, authenticate users, and keep sessions active across web, mobile, and connected ChatGPT experiences."}]]}],["$","li","To personalize coaching responses, including habit guidance, meal planning, workout coaching, educator help, and user summary generation.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To personalize coaching responses, including habit guidance, meal planning, workout coaching, educator help, and user summary generation."}]]}],["$","li","To save workouts, nutrition logs, community posts, check-ins, reports, and preferences at the user’s direction.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To save workouts, nutrition logs, community posts, check-ins, reports, and preferences at the user’s direction."}]]}],["$","li","To generate reports, adherence summaries, streaks, trend views, and progress insights.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To generate reports, adherence summaries, streaks, trend views, and progress insights."}]]}],["$","li","To deliver optional notifications and reminders that the user has chosen to receive.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To deliver optional notifications and reminders that the user has chosen to receive."}]]}],["$","li","To operate community features, including displaying posts, reactions, replies, and check-in content to relevant users.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To operate community features, including displaying posts, reactions, replies, and check-in content to relevant users."}]]}],["$","li","To provide store recommendations, product suggestions, and coach support flows tied to user activity and profile context.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To provide store recommendations, product suggestions, and coach support flows tied to user activity and profile context."}]]}],["$","li","To support connected ChatGPT tool use, including processing tool inputs and returning tool outputs and UI widgets requested by the user.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"To support connected ChatGPT tool use, including processing tool inputs and returning tool outputs and UI widgets requested by the user."}]]}],["$","li","To secure the service, troubleshoot issues, audit misuse, and maintain performance and reliability.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],"$L35"]}]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","How ChatGPT-Connected Tools Use Data",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"How ChatGPT-Connected Tools Use Data"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","When a user connects Steady AI to ChatGPT, tool inputs provided through ChatGPT are sent to Steady AI so the requested tool can run.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"When a user connects Steady AI to ChatGPT, tool inputs provided through ChatGPT are sent to Steady AI so the requested tool can run."}]]}],["$","li","Tool inputs may include profile data, coaching prompts, meal text, workout session details, community draft content, notification preferences, or an authenticated user identifier depending on the tool used.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Tool inputs may include profile data, coaching prompts, meal text, workout session details, community draft content, notification preferences, or an authenticated user identifier depending on the tool used."}]]}],["$","li","Tool outputs may include generated guidance, workout cards, nutrition summaries, user summaries, check-in drafts, and other structured results returned to ChatGPT for display to the user.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Tool outputs may include generated guidance, workout cards, nutrition summaries, user summaries, check-in drafts, and other structured results returned to ChatGPT for display to the user."}]]}],["$","li","Static widget resources used to render cards in ChatGPT do not by themselves contain personal data, but personalized tool calls can return user-linked content when the user is authenticated or provides a user identifier.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Static widget resources used to render cards in ChatGPT do not by themselves contain personal data, but personalized tool calls can return user-linked content when the user is authenticated or provides a user identifier."}]]}],["$","li","If a tool performs a write action, such as logging nutrition, saving a workout session, updating workout preferences, or creating a community check-in post, the relevant submitted data is stored in the user account so the product can reflect that action later.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"If a tool performs a write action, such as logging nutrition, saving a workout session, updating workout preferences, or creating a community check-in post, the relevant submitted data is stored in the user account so the product can reflect that action later."}]]}]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","Disclosures And Recipients",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"Disclosures And Recipients"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","Service providers and infrastructure vendors: we use hosted infrastructure and software providers to support authentication, databases, storage, hosting, and delivery of the application.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Service providers and infrastructure vendors: we use hosted infrastructure and software providers to support authentication, databases, storage, hosting, and delivery of the application."}]]}],["$","li","Supabase and similar backend services may process account data, authentication tokens, database records, and stored content to provide sign-in, storage, and application functionality.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Supabase and similar backend services may process account data, authentication tokens, database records, and stored content to provide sign-in, storage, and application functionality."}]]}],["$","li","AI model providers may process prompts and related context needed to generate requested coaching, nutrition, education, and community guidance outputs.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"AI model providers may process prompts and related context needed to generate requested coaching, nutrition, education, and community guidance outputs."}]]}],["$","li","Community recipients: when a user publishes a post, check-in, or reaction, that content is disclosed to other users who can access the relevant community surface.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Community recipients: when a user publishes a post, check-in, or reaction, that content is disclosed to other users who can access the relevant community surface."}]]}],["$","li","Legal or safety disclosures: we may disclose information when reasonably necessary to comply with law, enforce terms, protect users, or respond to valid legal process.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Legal or safety disclosures: we may disclose information when reasonably necessary to comply with law, enforce terms, protect users, or respond to valid legal process."}]]}],["$","li","Business transfers: data may be transferred as part of a merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets, subject to applicable law.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Business transfers: data may be transferred as part of a merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets, subject to applicable law."}]]}]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","Data Retention",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"Data Retention"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","Account and profile records are retained while the account remains active and for a reasonable period afterward to support security, fraud prevention, and legal compliance.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Account and profile records are retained while the account remains active and for a reasonable period afterward to support security, fraud prevention, and legal compliance."}]]}],["$","li","Coaching logs, workout data, nutrition logs, reports, challenge participation, store history, and community content are retained until deleted by the user, removed by the service, or no longer needed for product and legal purposes.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Coaching logs, workout data, nutrition logs, reports, challenge participation, store history, and community content are retained until deleted by the user, removed by the service, or no longer needed for product and legal purposes."}]]}],["$","li","Notification logs, security logs, and operational records may be kept for a limited period needed for reliability, troubleshooting, abuse prevention, and audit purposes.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Notification logs, security logs, and operational records may be kept for a limited period needed for reliability, troubleshooting, abuse prevention, and audit purposes."}]]}],["$","li","Temporary OAuth codes, sessions, and short-lived connection state are retained only for the duration needed to complete authentication and maintain secure access.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Temporary OAuth codes, sessions, and short-lived connection state are retained only for the duration needed to complete authentication and maintain secure access."}]]}],["$","li","Where deletion is requested, backups and residual copies may persist for a limited period before they are overwritten in the ordinary course of operations.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Where deletion is requested, backups and residual copies may persist for a limited period before they are overwritten in the ordinary course of operations."}]]}]]}]]}]
25:["$","section","User Controls And Choices",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"User Controls And Choices"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","Users can choose whether to enable optional health, location, motion, and notification-related features.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users can choose whether to enable optional health, location, motion, and notification-related features."}]]}],["$","li","Users can choose whether to connect Steady AI to ChatGPT and whether to authenticate a ChatGPT session against their account.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users can choose whether to connect Steady AI to ChatGPT and whether to authenticate a ChatGPT session against their account."}]]}],["$","li","Users can edit profile and onboarding information through product flows when available.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users can edit profile and onboarding information through product flows when available."}]]}],["$","li","Users can choose whether to create community posts, reactions, and check-ins; those features are not automatic.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users can choose whether to create community posts, reactions, and check-ins; those features are not automatic."}]]}],["$","li","Users can change notification preferences and reminder schedules.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users can change notification preferences and reminder schedules."}]]}],["$","li","Users can request account deletion or data deletion, subject to legal, security, and operational retention requirements.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Users can request account deletion or data deletion, subject to legal, security, and operational retention requirements."}]]}]]}]]}]
26:["$","section","Sensitive And Health-Related Data",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"Sensitive And Health-Related Data"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","Steady AI is designed so health summary sync and related device or sensor features are optional and user-initiated.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Steady AI is designed so health summary sync and related device or sensor features are optional and user-initiated."}]]}],["$","li","When health-related data is used, it is used to provide the specific tracking, report, or coaching function requested by the user.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"When health-related data is used, it is used to provide the specific tracking, report, or coaching function requested by the user."}]]}],["$","li","Certain MCP summary flows are designed to avoid including raw health data where not needed and instead use reduced or summary-level inputs.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Certain MCP summary flows are designed to avoid including raw health data where not needed and instead use reduced or summary-level inputs."}]]}]]}]]}]
27:["$","section","Cookies, Sessions, And Authentication",{"className":"rounded-[28px] border border-[#ead9ca] bg-[#fffaf5] p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"Cookies, Sessions, And Authentication"}],null,["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5f5145]","children":[["$","li","We use cookies, bearer tokens, session identifiers, and related authentication state to keep users signed in, support secure OAuth flows, and connect ChatGPT sessions to the correct account when authorized.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"We use cookies, bearer tokens, session identifiers, and related authentication state to keep users signed in, support secure OAuth flows, and connect ChatGPT sessions to the correct account when authorized."}]]}],["$","li","These mechanisms are used for security and product operation and are not a promise that tracking technologies are limited only to advertising or analytics contexts.",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#7a4b28]"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"These mechanisms are used for security and product operation and are not a promise that tracking technologies are limited only to advertising or analytics contexts."}]]}]]}]]}]
